tense:{name:"Reported speech",use:"Menyampaikan kembali ucapan orang lain. Tense biasanya mundur satu langkah.",
form:[["langsung","She said, 'I am busy.'"],["tak langsung","She said (that) she was busy."],["tanya","He asked if I was free. · She asked what time it started."]],
markers:"say, tell, ask, explain, mention · that, if / whether",
ex:["He told me he would be late.","She said she had finished the report.","They asked whether we could join."],
tip:"Mundur: am/is → was, will → would, can → could, have done → had done. tell butuh objek (tell me), say tidak (say that)."},
